  <data name="Triggers_TypesDesc" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Trigger — reacts to the element's own property (IsMouseOver, IsFocused)
• DataTrigger — reacts to a binding value from ViewModel
• MultiDataTrigger — fires when multiple conditions are met simultaneously</value></data>
